osition":{"commit_sha":"fb6d74c638de38e5b1cf6d6012e4fb02a9e09834","position":"1794608160538282764-c13f4254-a8d8-4f83-95bb-1b585eabdd32"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"01e354d46ab87ee0b6f76068046603f7008d8a714f838569ddaba2267411069a","event_uuid":"9e79b93a-46b0-4d59-8e43-3bce39e4bb3d","position":{"commit_sha":"ed191e53fa7ef1db60119a48402cd688f4656060","position":"1794608659593595001-9e79b93a-46b0-4d59-8e43-3bce39e4bb3d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"87bb5e01bd116f20e800659efdbdcd9cfbb0e15b06f5028c8f87a10decef8e6f","event_uuid":"233d36ef-296c-41bf-aee3-ff119a93200a","position":{"commit_sha":"86b26770c6ab5411365a65766362f42583a7c41e","position":"1794608661521101001-233d36ef-296c-41bf-aee3-ff119a93200a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"plan_defect","comments":[],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1794603464391973449,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"5045ca44-21ce-4d33-b716-9eab480fc51a","provenance":"explicit","relation":"caused_by","target_id":"e57f-200d-d402-4a5e"},{"link_uuid":"363e4c3b-63b0-4d98-abdc-108ca95c9181","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"f5cb-b168-3dfb-4920"}],"description":"## Problem\n\nOn 2026-11-13 the operator confirmed that rebar has no rule saying an agentic plan review that read no code is never signed. Change 3392 (`bf7d496eedc`, bug `bridal-gifted-vampirebat`) added that rule anyway. It came from an agent's reading of the epic's \"Fail closed\" invariant. That invariant covers runs that do not finish cleanly with schema-valid output. It says nothing about which tools the agent calls.\n\nToday an agentic run that completes cleanly but makes no `read_file`, `search_files` or `list_directory` call resolves to an unsigned INDETERMINATE (`resolution_class` FIX_AGENT_DESIGN) instead of the verdict its findings produce.\n\nWhere the rule lives on origin/main:\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/gate_dispatch.py`, around line 249: the `agentic_unread_error` check and its early return through `_degraded_plan_review_verdict`.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/plan_review_recovery.py`:\n  - `agentic_unread_error`, `_CODE_READ_TOOLS`;\n  - `STEP_AGENTIC_REVIEW` added to the required step ids, which exists only to keep that check from being silently disabled.\n- `docs/adr/0123-selectable-plan-review-engine.md` §3, around line 92: the \"An agentic run that read no code ... is never signed (amended 2026-11-13 ...)\" paragraph.\n- Tests:\n  - `tests/unit/test_plan_review_agentic_verdict.py`, the section \"an agent that read no code is never signed\";\n  - `tests/unit/test_plan_review_agentic.py`, the real-runner `_usage` code-read tests.\n\n## Plan\n\nRemove exactly what `bf7d496eedc` added, so behavior returns to what it was before that commit:\n1. In `gate_dispatch.py`, remove the check and its early return.\n2. In `plan_review_recovery.py`, remove `agentic_unread_error` and `_CODE_READ_TOOLS`. Restore the required step-id set to its pre-`bf7d496eedc` contents. Remove `STEP_AGENTIC_REVIEW` unless something other than the rule uses it.\n3. In ADR 0123 §3, remove the paragraph. Add a dated 2026-11-13 amendment note saying it was withdrawn because the operator never decided it. Keep the existing \"Fail closed\" rule for failed runs unchanged.\n4. Remove the rule's tests. Add a RED test showing that an agentic run which completes cleanly with zero `blocker` findings and no code-read calls PASSes and is signed.\n5. Check the agentic success path is otherwise identical to its state at `aa1681bb531^` minus `bf7d496eedc`. A `git revert` of `bf7d496eedc`, resolved against the later ADR edits, is acceptable.\n\nNo config key, env var or flag. No other behavior change. The other fail-closed paths stay intact: errors, timeouts, limits, refusals and invalid output.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] `git grep -n -iE 'agentic_unread|read no code|_CODE_READ_TOOLS' -- src docs tests` prints nothing.\n- [x] A test shows a clean agentic run with zero blocker findings and no code-read calls PASSes and is signed.\n- [x] The existing fail-closed tests for failed agentic runs still pass, unchanged.\n- [x] ADR 0123 carries a dated 2026-11-13 note withdrawing the rule.\n- [x] `make verify` exits 0.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","f5cb-b168-3dfb-4920"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"9e79b93a-46b0-4d59-8e43-3bce39e4bb3d","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f6ce-0570-680e-401a","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Remove the unrequested \"agentic review that read no code is never signed\" rule","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["798e18f0-713a-4ac5-935e-f82b1db8d8bb","5045ca44-21ce-4d33-b716-9eab480fc51a","238d05d3-6a36-4de4-aca7-0295026ec00f","273f3261-198b-42ab-abc2-abd870c14f15","dd12896d-2136-4f22-972b-b2b06a10d333","363e4c3b-63b0-4d98-abdc-108ca95c9181","c13f4254-a8d8-4f83-95bb-1b585eabdd32","9e79b93a-46b0-4d59-8e43-3bce39e4bb3d","233d36ef-296c-41bf-aee3-ff119a93200a"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794608661521101002,"uuid":"02ac72f7-eac9-49c4-9713-4c475fdc2061"}